Description: Generates artificial binary landscapes with defined spatial
    patterns and classifies landscapes by pattern using neural networks. The
    pixel-based workflow trains a convolutional neural network directly on
    raster cells with 'keras3'. The metrics-based workflow calculates landscape
    metrics with 'landscapemetrics' and trains a neural network with 'neuralnet'.
    The package supports landscape generation, metric calculation and selection,
    model training, cross-validation, application to new landscapes, and
    visualization of landscapes, metrics, and classification results.
URL: https://ecomods.github.io/patternscaper/,
    https://github.com/ecomods/patternscaper/
